WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.880
Since we can't catch them

00:01.960 --> 00:03.360
Then don't catch them

00:04.600 --> 00:05.800
Break up the volunteers

00:05.880 --> 00:07.400
Integrate them into the garrison

00:07.480 --> 00:10.000
Have officers of battalion rank and above take charge

00:10.080 --> 00:11.200
So spies

00:11.280 --> 00:11.720
Have no way

00:11.800 --> 00:13.400
To organize together as units

00:13.480 --> 00:14.400
Add more personnel

00:14.560 --> 00:15.960
Strictly guard the gates

00:16.320 --> 00:17.720
Should be safe

00:20.000 --> 00:21.080
Your Highness

00:21.160 --> 00:23.160
Having everyone hand over their command

00:23.480 --> 00:25.480
My men are fine with it

00:26.240 --> 00:27.640
But other leaders

00:28.400 --> 00:29.840
May not agree

00:30.440 --> 00:31.600
This matter

00:31.680 --> 00:33.000
Relies on Commander Liu

00:33.080 --> 00:34.120
Please, Commander Liu

00:34.200 --> 00:35.867
Give the brothers advance notice

00:35.960 --> 00:37.360
When my men arrive

00:37.440 --> 00:38.840
To arrange entry

00:39.200 --> 00:40.600
Set an example

00:42.920 --> 00:44.200
Leaders

00:44.280 --> 00:45.600
Hesitation is normal

00:45.680 --> 00:46.880
But the hesitant

00:46.960 --> 00:48.627
Often follow the loudest voice

00:50.760 --> 00:53.280
What if someone absolutely refuses?

00:55.680 --> 00:57.080
Then please

00:57.480 --> 00:58.880
Turn back

01:02.480 --> 01:03.880
Yes

01:20.480 --> 01:21.080
Damn it

01:21.160 --> 01:22.400
I won't take this insult

01:22.480 --> 01:23.760
We brothers rushed here

01:23.840 --> 01:24.160
Isn't it

01:24.240 --> 01:25.760
To fight the Wuzhao?

01:26.000 --> 01:26.800
Old Liu

01:26.880 --> 01:28.280
You can fool everyone

01:28.400 --> 01:29.800
But don't fool yourself

01:30.320 --> 01:32.280
Everyone said to get benefits together

01:33.080 --> 01:34.240
You didn't take more for yourself, did you?

01:34.320 --> 01:34.840
No

01:34.920 --> 01:36.320
Those bastards in Yiyang

01:36.400 --> 01:37.520
I'm done serving them

01:37.600 --> 01:38.600
Let's go

01:38.680 --> 01:39.440
You

01:39.520 --> 01:40.760
You all

01:40.840 --> 01:42.200
Go

